Build on PHP 8.6 (backport of upstream's PHP 8.6 compatibility fixes)

Snuffleupagus 0.14.0 does not compile against PHP 8.6: php_hash_bin2hex()
is gone (zend_bin2hex() replaces it) and internal functions' arg_info[].name
is now a zend_string. Without this patch the 8.6 build fails and 8.6 pools
would run with no PHP Defense.

Squash of upstream commits 4feaa001c, b8f4cd7f7, e765f2fd6, c78c14165,
cdcad800c and 9e0a8de9f (2026-10-13), not yet in a release. The 8.6 changes
are behind PHP_VERSION_ID >= 80600. The other two compile to the same code
on PHP 8.0-8.5: zval_is_true() is an alias of zend_is_true(), and
EMPTY_SWITCH_DEFAULT_CASE() expands to the default/ZEND_UNREACHABLE() it is
replaced with. Drop this patch when bumping to a release that has them.

Applied at build time by ../apply-patches.sh (all patches or none).
Upstream: https://github.com/jvoisin/snuffleupagus

